  "schema:name": "Synchronized SCP active for all complex patients and reduced conflicting clinical decisions",
  "schema:description": "A fully synchronized, multi-provider Shared Care Plan (SCP) is active for every patient with complex or chronic needs, with documented goals, responsibilities, and progress visible to all authorized providers and the patient resulting in measurable improvement in care plan adherence and reduction in conflicting clinical decisions.",
